{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Calm Loop 是一款可離線使用的睡眠聲音應用，內置白噪音、雨聲、風扇聲、棕色噪音與粉紅噪音等 46 種聲源，支援混合兩層聲音並設定淡出睡眠計時器，適合入睡困難、需要穩定背景聲或照顧嬰兒的用戶。原價 US $3.99 的終生版內購現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-136.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>雙聲混音配合淡出計時</h2>\n<p>每層聲音可獨立調節音量，混合後可命名儲存，並把常用組合設為最愛。睡眠計時器可選 15 至 120 分鐘或自訂時間，結束時聲音緩緩淡出而非突然中斷。螢幕關閉後仍可背景播放。全部聲音隨應用下載，離線或飛機上同樣可用，另設燈籠夜燈與嬰兒房音量上限。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-407-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-408-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-409-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-410-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-411-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-412-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Calm Loop: White Noise &amp; Sleep 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Calm Loop: White Noise &amp; Sleep</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/apple-store/id6752226670\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:01:17.544813+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":444,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:34.654023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:58:32.886370+00:00","content_hash":"d8d8f70d6941f56a0c0ac73c92c8148370161f94b14075b8f0135ae7e5663102","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}